n\n-\n16\n \n30\n-\nJun\n-\n21\n \n100,000\n \n0\n \n100,000\n \n \n \nNotes:\n \nIn the Agriculture and Natural Resources sector in India, all ongoing project\ns under ADB \nfinancing are primarily supporting irrigation, flood control and water resources management \nprojects. However, under Loan 3265\n-\n \nOrissa\n \nIntegrated Irrigated Agriculture and Water \nManagement Investment Program, the expected outcome of the investm\nent in modernization \nand management of irrigation system and associated infrastructure,\n \nis to increase productivity \nof agriculture in the Mahanadi delta, Brahmani and Baitrani river basins in Odisha.\n \n \n36.\n \nNational Centre for cold Chain Development (NCCD), \nDepartment of Agriculture, \nCooperation  & Famers Welfare under MoU with,  Deutsche Gesellschaft fur Internationale \nZusammenarbeit (GIZ) GmbH is implementing TA Project on Green Innovation Centers for the  \nAgriculture  and Food Sector (GIC project) as part \nof “Arrangement by way of the Agreement \nbetween the Government of the Federal Republic of Germany and the Government of \nIndia(DEA) on Technical Cooperation (sig\nn\ned on 22\nnd\n \nJune, 2015)” in the State of Maharashtra \nand Karnataka. Further, in accordance with \nthe agreement dated June 22, 2015, Government of \nFederal Republic of Germany shall provide GIZ with up to EUR 8,000,000 for the German \nContribution. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \nAnnexure II\n \n \nAnnexure refer to in part (c) of LS USQ No 477 due for answe\nr on 19/12/2017\n \n \nS. No.\n \nProject Name\n \nState/Central\n \nInternational \nAgency\n \n1\n.\n \n \nFostering Climate Resilient Upland Farming \nSystems in the Northeast (FOCUS) \n(Nagaland)\n \nNagaland\n \nIFAD\n \n2\n.\n \n \nFostering Climate Resilient Upland Farming \nSystems in the Northeast (FOCUS) \n(Mi\nzoram)\n \nMizoram\n \nIFAD\n \n3\n.\n \n \nHimachal Pradesh Crop Diversification \nPromo